 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to the United Kingdom decreased after Brexit.",
  "The exports peaked at 621.7 million euros in 2019 but fell to 359.6 million euros by 2025.",
  "This represents a decline of 32.1% from 2016 to 2025.",
  "The data are presented in current euros and do not account for price changes over time.",
  "Therefore, the nominal values may not fully reflect real changes in trade volume."
 ],
